# MC-X-F13 (writer 9). pay[] is booked at 2027-02-01 with v1's amt, 100.00 PLN. v2 (known 2027-03-01) ends it (its
# when is false): E §5 step 3 "when V ends one, δ = −A_previous", one adjustment, adjustments[pay.cash, v2], change
# -100.00 PLN. v3 (known 2027-04-01) touches amt but leaves the instance ended: before and after it the instance
# counts as 0 (E §5 step 1), δ = 0 and no leg's places change, so nothing is recorded (E §5 step 4). snap13: q1-q3
# REFCORE-NOT-YET (AttributeError: 'NoneType' object has no attribute 'unit'), at the v3 step.
=== m.tally
model f13
  tally 2
  on 2027-12-31
  start 2027-01-01
  end 2027-12-31
  note "MC-X-F13: a plan instance booked, ended by a later version, and still ended under a version known after that."

unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
source s "s"
place konto: accounts PLN lives 2020-01-01..
place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..

input amt: money PLN
input pay_day: date

move pay: transfers
  on pay_day
  when amt > 0 PLN
  leg cash from world to konto amount amt

ask q1: count(a in adjustments over ..)
ask q2: sum(a.change for a in adjustments over ..)
ask q3: a.change for a in adjustments over ..

version v1
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-12-01
  amt = 100.00 PLN
  pay_day = 2027-02-01
  opening[konto] = 0 PLN at 2027-01-01 start

version v2
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2027-03-01
  replace amt = 0 PLN

version v3
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2027-04-01
  replace amt = -5.00 PLN
=== expect
q1: 1
  cut 2027-12-31
q2: -100.00 PLN
  cut 2027-12-31
q3 (a = adjustments[pay.cash, v2]): -100.00 PLN
  cut 2027-12-31
